## Agent-as-archivist triggers

This agent archives a note when **at least one** of these is true:

- [ ] The note's status is `stale`
- [ ] The note is older than 30 days AND has no wikilinks from active notes
- [ ] The note is a duplicate (confirmed by a wikilink audit)
- [ ] The operator has explicit approved the archive

**Notes:**
- [Any archive reason not in this list — agent CANNOT archive for those reasons]
- [Any archive format requirement]

