## Audit-line format

Per-tool audit lines are written to: [vault log.md path / kanban event log / both].

**Format:**
```
## [ISO8601-UTC] <action-kind> — <subject>: <what changed> (<optional strategy>)
```

**Action kinds:** `read`, `propose`, `edit`, `scaffold`, `archive`, `wikilink-create`, `tag-apply`, `move`, `delete`.

**Notes:**
- [Any agent-specific audit-line additions, e.g., "include confidence score in every edit audit line"]
- [Any audit-line suppression, e.g., "don't audit per-file-access reads"]

