## The 5-question interaction audit (run quarterly)

1. **Is the agent respecting the read-then-write discipline?** (Every edit has a read in the same session.) → fix if not.
2. **Is the agent within budget?** (Tool calls < budget per session.) → adjust budget or agent behavior.
3. **Is the agent creating parallel structures?** (New tiers / sub-vaults without operator review.) → flag for review.
4. **Is the agent archiving by judgment?** (Any archive without the 4 evidence triggers.) → flag for review.
5. **Is the agent writing audit lines?** (Every state-change has an audit line.) → fix if not.

